  "body": "Welcome to 20 Mahinga Kai Road, Orewa, a brand-new home where thoughtful design, warm contemporary finishes and effortless indoor-outdoor living come together beautifully.\r\n\r\nSet on a 176sqm section, the north-facing open-plan kitchen, dining and living area enjoys excellent natural light throughout the day. A distinctive architectural ceiling detail adds character and creates a striking focal point, while large sliding doors open directly onto the deck for seamless everyday living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe contemporary kitchen makes an immediate impression with its warm timber cabinetry, clean lines, excellent storage and quality Bosch appliances. Stylish and highly functional, it forms a welcoming centrepiece for the home.\r\n\r\nThree well-proportioned bedrooms are complemented by two beautifully finished bathrooms, including an ensuite for the master bedroom. One of the bedrooms also enjoys direct access to the deck, creating a lovely connection to the private outdoor space.\r\n\r\nA separate laundry with a built-in tub adds everyday practicality, while the intercom system and easy-care garden make daily living refreshingly simple. The Halo 10-Year Residential Guarantee provides added peace of mind for years to come.\r\n\r\nFeatures You’ll Love :\r\n\r\n• Three bedrooms and two stylish bathrooms\r\n•  Master bedroom with ensuite\r\n•  North-facing open-plan kitchen, dining and living\r\n•  Distinctive architectural ceiling detail in the living area\r\n•  Contemporary kitchen with quality Bosch appliances\r\n•  Excellent kitchen storage and warm timber finishes\r\n•  Seamless flow from the living area to the deck\r\n•  Direct deck access from one bedroom\r\n•  Separate laundry with a built-in tub\r\n•  Intercom system\r\n•  Smart Security Camera with AI tracking and Floodlights\r\n•  Easy-care garden\r\n•  Halo 10-Year Residential Guarantee\r\n\r\nViewing Directions :\r\n\r\nEnter 251 West Hoe Heights, Orewa into your GPS. Turn left at the roundabout, enter the development when you see the Strathmill sign, then follow the directional signs to 20 Mahinga Kai Road.\r\n\r\nSet within Orewa’s exciting Strathmill community, this stylish home is ideal for first-home buyers, downsizers, couples or small families seeking modern, low-maintenance living. The future Flavell Drive connection is expected to improve access towards State Highway 1, adding further convenience to this growing location.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your viewing.",
